#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Unified GLM-5.2 ROCm/MI355X patch bundle for SGLang daily images.

Purpose:
  Apply the local runtime patches used for GLM-5.2-FP8 on MI355X/ROCm in one
  idempotent file, so a launch command only needs:

      python3 /data/patch_sglang_glm52_rocm_all.py && exec python3 -m sglang.launch_server ...

Included patch modules:
  01_patch_0704_merged.py              - HIP/DSA/MTP/AITER enablement patch set
  02_patch_fp8_preshuffle_0704.py      - mark AITER/ROCm FP8 pre-shuffled weights (4 paths)
  03_patch_fp8_view_fix.py             - HIP FP8 uint8 buffer view fix for DSV4 JIT
  04_patch_dsa_target_verify_fix.py    - breakable graph + MTP target_verify metadata guard
  05_patch_dsa_fused_store_rocm_fp8.py - ROCm-safe FP8 pack for DSA fused store JIT

Notes for 20260706 image:
  - Contains upstream #26788 DSA topk/page-table transform at commit 80decc7.
  - The fused_store_index_cache.cuh ROCm pack_fp8 issue is still present in
    upstream main at the time this bundle was created, so patch 05 is still needed
    if we choose to test fused-store. Because iWiki warns previous fused-store
    conversion attempts hurt quality/perf, validate accept rate before production.
  - This file includes a fixed idempotency check for patch 01 / subpatch 1.1,
    because the original /data/patch_0704_merged.py fails on second run.
"""
